+
+/*
+ * A file's extension in muted ink, in the documents tree and on tabs (R13; iconLabel.ts `splitExtension`). The name is
+ * the body ink. On the chosen tab and the open row the name is in ink and the extension a step quieter, in body (the
+ * kit's `.tb.on .ext`, the Experience lead, 19 October). On a pointed-at row or tab, in high contrast, and where a file
+ * decoration colours the name, the extension takes the name's own colour.
+ */
